# Sign in with Apple — optional. Leave all five unset to skip registering the
# provider (iOS falls back to email sign-in). Apple Developer setup: create an
# App ID with the "Sign in with Apple" capability → a Services ID (web flow
# client id) → a Key with Sign in with Apple enabled → download its .p8 file.
#
# Services ID (e.g. fans.sense.si). Used as the OAuth client id for the web flow.
# APPLE_CLIENT_ID=
# 10-character Team ID from the Apple Developer membership page.
# APPLE_TEAM_ID=
# Key ID of the .p8 key (shown next to the key in Certificates, IDs & Profiles).
# APPLE_KEY_ID=
# Full contents of the .p8 file. Newlines may be escaped as \n on one line.
# APPLE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----"
# iOS bundle identifier. Required for native idToken sign-in — the app sends it
# as the token audience instead of the Services ID.
# APPLE_APP_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER=
